  "body": "Welcome home to Apartment 11! Fully refurbished and is ideally positioned on Level 1, enjoying a pleasant outlook over the tennis courts. The apartment features two spacious bedrooms, one modern bathroom, approximately 82sqm of internal living space, and a generous deck perfect for relaxing or entertaining. \r\n\r\nLiving at Norfolk Apartments means enjoying the freedom of an independent lifestyle with the reassurance of a caring community. Residents benefit from:\r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained gardens and tranquil surroundings.\r\nDay-to-day management providing peace of mind.\r\n24-hour St John medical alarm support.\r\nSecure \"lock-up-and-leave\" living ideal for travel or visiting family.\r\nWeekly morning teas and regular resident social gatherings that foster a warm and welcoming community.\r\nLight-filled communal spaces for relaxing and connecting with neighbours.\r\nThe location is simply outstanding. Just a short stroll away you'll find:\r\n\r\nMairangi Bay Beach and the stunning coastal walkway.\r\nMairangi Bay Village with its cafes, shops and supermarket.\r\nMedical centre and everyday services.\r\nPublic transport for easy access across Auckland.\r\nThe local bowling and tennis clubs, offering excellent recreational opportunities.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for quality independent retirement living in one of Auckland's finest beachside suburbs, this is an opportunity not to be missed. Phone Ethan today to view!",
